              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos^{2} \\frac{x}{2}-\\sin^{2} \\frac{x}{2}=\\sin (\\frac{\\pi}{2}-2x)\"></span> . </li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Ука­жи­те корни урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[\\pi,\\frac{5\\pi}{2}]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T15:45:37.578141+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{2\\pi k}{3}\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{4\\pi}{3};2\\pi\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T15:45:37.578141+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\"><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"29575db2-8b91-435d-ab33-28324f3266cb\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние, по­лу­ча­ем  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x=\\cos 2x\"></span>. Зна­чит, <span data-inline-latex=\"2x=x+2\\pi k\"></span> или <span data-inline-latex=\"x=-2x+2\\pi k\"></span>, где <span data-inline-latex=\"k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . В пер­вом слу­чае <span data-inline-latex=\"x=2\\pi k\"></span>, во вто­ром слу­чае <span data-inline-latex=\"x=\\frac{2\\pi k}{3}\"></span> ,  где <span data-inline-latex=\"k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . Пер­вая серия ре­ше­ний вхо­дит во вто­рую.</li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">От­ме­тим ре­ше­ния на три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ской окруж­но­сти. От­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[\\pi,\\frac{5\\pi}{2}]\"></span>  при­над­ле­жат корни  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{4\\pi}{3}\"></span>  и <span data-inline-latex=\"2\\pi\"></span> .</li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
